DO $$
DECLARE eid integer; s1 integer; s2 integer; s3 integer; s4 integer;
BEGIN

Caller: I would like to book badminton for two people. Is equipment included?
Receptionist: Court hire includes nets, but rackets cost three pounds each to rent. Please bring clean indoor shoes. If you book online before noon, the evening court costs twelve pounds instead of fifteen.
Caller: Great. Can I park nearby?
Receptionist: Yes, the public car park behind the centre is free for the first two hours.','Questions 1–10: Read or listen carefully and answer every question.','',1) RETURNING id INTO s1;

Student: I enjoy practical work, but I am worried about the statistics module.
Tutor: There is a support class on Thursday afternoons. You can also borrow the recommended textbook from the library; there is no need to buy it immediately. Your first field trip is to the coastal reserve on the second Friday of term.
Student: Do I need special clothing?
Tutor: Bring waterproof boots and a notebook. We will provide all measuring equipment.','Questions 11–20: Read or listen carefully and answer every question.','',2) RETURNING id INTO s2;

Visitor: Where can we see the clock exhibition?
Guide: That is in Room 14 on the second floor. We will spend twenty minutes there before stopping at the café. The café serves soup and sandwiches until three o’clock.
Visitor: Are children given activity sheets?
Guide: Yes, collect them from the information desk. There is also a quiet family room next to the shop.','Questions 21–30: Read or listen carefully and answer every question.','',3) RETURNING id INTO s3;

The riverside cycle path will also be closed for repairs between the market bridge and the theatre. A signed diversion goes through Willow Park. Cyclists should allow an extra ten minutes for their journey.

Rail passengers should note that Sunday tickets can be booked online from today. Paper timetables will be available at the station from Friday.','Questions 31–40: Read or listen carefully and answer every question.','',4) RETURNING id INTO s4;
END $$;

