  (eid,s4,'mcq','Where is the car park?','In front of the pool','Behind the centre','Beside the railway','Under the sports hall',1,'','The first two hours are free, not charged.',37),
  (eid,s4,'gap','Complete the summary with ONE OR TWO words: The swimming pool opens at ______ in the morning.','','','','',0,'six|6|6 am|six am','The receptionist offers free tours on weekday evenings.',38),
